  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FCDO Yemen Pilot Proposal for Funding Mechanism to Women&apos;s Rights Organizations</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Foreign Commonwealth &amp; Development Office (FCDO) is launching a pilot funding mechanism for Women&apos;s Rights Organizations (WROs) in Yemen with a budget of &#xa3;200,000. This six-month initiative aims to enhance the humanitarian response by integrating the expertise and voices of Yemeni WROs, focusing on food security and livelihood resilience.

Key components include increasing the influence of WROs, establishing a funding platform to support 5-10 WROs with initial grants up to &#xa3;20,000, and providing technical support for grant management. The project will also strengthen WROs&apos; capacities for donor funding management, promote community engagement to combat harmful social norms, and integrate women&#x2019;s perspectives in humanitarian coordination.</narrative>
  </description>
